---
title: OpenClaw Audit Suite — Data Flow (Leadsie → Dashboard)
---
sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as Prospect
    participant Leadsie as Leadsie Connect
    participant WH as Webhook Handler
    participant TV as Token Vault
    participant Adapters as Platform Adapters
    participant Engines as Audit Engines
    participant Scorer as Opportunity Scorer
    participant Dash as React Dashboard
    participant Sales as Sales Handoff

    Client->>Leadsie: Clicks connect link
    Note over Leadsie: Grants access to<br/>Meta, Google, Shopify,<br/>Stripe, Slack, etc.

    Leadsie->>WH: POST webhook<br/>{status: SUCCESS, assets: [...]}
    WH->>WH: Validate payload
    WH->>TV: Store OAuth tokens<br/>(AES-256-GCM encrypted)

    par Pull data from all platforms
        WH->>Adapters: Meta Ads pull (90 days)
        WH->>Adapters: Google Ads pull (90 days)
        WH->>Adapters: GA4 pull (90 days)
        WH->>Adapters: GTM pull (containers)
        WH->>Adapters: Shopify pull (90 days)
        WH->>Adapters: Stripe pull (90 days)
        WH->>Adapters: Gmail metadata pull
        WH->>Adapters: Slack metadata pull
        WH->>Adapters: Drive inventory pull
        WH->>Adapters: Docs inventory pull
        WH->>Adapters: WhatsApp metrics pull
    end

    Note over Adapters: Promise.allSettled<br/>Partial failures OK

    par Run audit engines
        Adapters->>Engines: Meta Ads audit
        Adapters->>Engines: Google Ads audit
        Adapters->>Engines: GA4 audit
        Adapters->>Engines: GTM audit
        Adapters->>Engines: Shopify audit
        Adapters->>Engines: Stripe audit
        Adapters->>Engines: Gmail audit
        Adapters->>Engines: Slack audit
        Adapters->>Engines: Drive audit
        Adapters->>Engines: Docs audit
        Adapters->>Engines: WhatsApp audit
    end

    Engines->>Engines: Cross-platform analysis

    Engines->>Scorer: All findings[]
    Scorer->>Scorer: Calculate revenue impact
    Scorer->>Scorer: Estimate effort
    Scorer->>Scorer: Rank by composite ROI
    Scorer->>Scorer: Map to OpenClaw agents
    Scorer->>Scorer: Generate total portfolio

    Scorer->>Dash: AuditReport via WebSocket
    Note over Dash: Hero: $X-$Y opportunity<br/>Platform scores<br/>Quick wins<br/>Agent proposals

    Dash->>Sales: Generate proposal
    Sales->>Sales: ROI projection
    Sales->>Sales: Use case narratives
    Sales-->>Client: Shareable link + PDF

    Note over Client: "Now I know exactly<br/>what OpenClaw can do<br/>for MY business"
